{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine? Tower!</strong>\u00a0blends classic <i>Minesweeper</i>\u00a0deduction with <i>Tower Defense</i>\u00a0base protection.<br>Open safe tiles to gather info, flag confirmed mines, then <strong>spend 1 build point</strong>\u00a0to construct towers and hold the line.<br> Short, replayable runs encourage \u201cone more try.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Rules</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open &amp; Deduce</strong>: Numbers indicate adjacent mines. Use logic to clear safe tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flags &amp; Towers</strong>: Place a flag on a confirmed mine and build a tower on it using <strong>1 build point</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chord (Auto-Open)</strong>: On an opened number, use <strong>left+right click</strong>, a quick <strong>double-click</strong>, or a <strong>middle-mouse click</strong>\u00a0to auto-open eligible neighbors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Over</strong>: Stepping on a mine or losing the castle ends the run.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle \u00d7 Defense</strong>: Carve a safe path with logic, stabilize lanes with towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snappy sessions</strong>\u00a0suited for quick retries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong>\u00a0for time and clear performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotkeys</strong>: R=Restart, ESC=Pause/Menu. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All screenshots are taken from gameplay.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4153400/b4bb9423da1c2e6dc5d30c34f1d38fe071401e96.jpg"},{"name":"Blink Sweep","path":"https://cdn.